---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About FormFix India" description="FormFix India is a free, browser-local document preparation tool for Indian online applications. No uploads, no registration, no payment.">
<h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">About FormFix India</h1>
<p class="text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-2xl">Free, browser-local tools for Indian online applications. No uploads, no registration, no payment.</p>
<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-6">
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🛠️</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">What it fixes</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">FormFix India helps people fix the most common file problems in online applications: a photo that is too large, a signature outside the required range, or a PDF that will not upload. Every tool runs in your browser. There is no server upload, no account and no payment in this version.</p></article>
  <article class="card p-5 md:p-6"><p class="text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🔒</p><h2 class="font-bold text-lg mt-2">Independent &amp; private</h2><p class="mt-2 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">The site is independent. It is not affiliated with SSC, UPSC or any government department, and it does not use government logos to imply endorsement.</p></article>
</div>
</Base>
